flowchart LR
  A[Immutable v1 producer events] --> W[Orders outbox writer]
  B[Post-purchase owner transaction] --> V2[Allowlisted v2 writer]
  V2 --> SC[Version 2 JSON Schema]
  W --> K[Debezium and Kafka]
  SC --> K
  K --> C[History validates v1 or v2]
  C --> I[Shared inbox ID/hash and sequence rules]
  I --> P[Owner-scoped order projection and timeline]
  C -->|unknown version/type/schema| D[Transactional DLQ]
  P --> R[Rebuild and reconciliation validate both versions]
